-- held at one, the flame tilt, three surface emissive powers that disagree,
-- the view factor of a tilted cylinder with a flame over the target refused,
-- the Bagster transmissivity within its band, the heat flux as a product and
-- the distance to a heat flux, and the Yellow Book pool fire reproduced with
-- its errata. Digest sections 14 to 22, and section 34.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A heat flux is quoted with the method that
-- made it. The Professional capstone grades the solid flame chain with a
-- STATED transmissivity, and no point source heat radiation, no setback and
-- no single route quantity.
-- ============================================================================

